2026-03-22 03:02:56,690 - astrapy.utils.request_tools - DEBUG - Response text: '{"data":{"documents":[{"_id":"e9bccd54d59c47e993fc313faa5ecedf","content":"Best earphone","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bass Edition Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"c8c0e750175241e1afc191abc2a6a344","content":"Super super head phones.the sound quality is absolutely amazing.and battery life is good.","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bass Edition Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"b74f21f2f14447419fb7c94db7a8fe18","content":"Best budget Bluetooth earphones by one plus ....sound quality superb.....bass also good .... vry good built quality ....fix 15 hours play back ....very fast order delivery by flipkart ....over all good","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"d5842583baeb4a33b8cf5df8afd3d7f1","content":"nice very beautiful Realme buds Very good soundbass quality very nice battery backup good","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"realme Buds Wireless Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"beea6ed2a8c54206a4be76240507b94f","content":"Looking nice product...I got just 1day delivery..11th I ordered...12th I received...in this price range this product is no1..I got blue...i gift to dear one.. must buy.. don't go other products on this price range is this best....next level headset...no other gives this much battery life 20hrs...mind blowing OnePlus bullet z.. presently I'm using realme wireless buds, both are best in this segment but OnePlus is more battery life n extra multiple device connectivity button n latest design...","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"2b1d0b5faa2143008c0ee432709de7e9","content":"Great product Very much useful for us. It has all the best... Like sound quality, battery back up, buid quality, fitting in the \uD83D\uDC42.. I recommend it for buy everyperson who's like wireless headphones...","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"2357f915e8684fdd87d845e5ae9fbb9d","content":"Very good product.. loved the color and sound quality \u2764\ufe0f It came with extra pairs of earbuds, overall the product is nice and worth money! Thank you Flipkart\uD83D\uDE0A","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"BoAt BassHeads 100 Wired Headset"}},{"_id":"d8bc1f2d0ef646a98c0cbde42cc378ee","content":"Worst product ever bought. Instead, you can go and try for \"Flipkart smartbuy bass beatz\". A very decent earphones in very reasonable price. Never go for boat airdopes 131 as this is just good in look and WORST in performance. Could have given 0 star if available in option.","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"BoAt Airdopes 131 Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"3927748ade13473fb1500ce33fe940e6","content":"Awesome product in such a low price...didn't expected..I never loved any earphone than samsung in ear headphones even akg headphones couldn't beat that and this realme bud is exactly like samsung in ear...loved it must buy","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"realme Buds Q Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"60ab8f267397464aac5aae4e13ccdda4","content":"Mind blowing parches. Very nice headset in low budget. Go for it. I think this is the best in this price range. I ordered on 22 August and got it on 23 August. Very fast delivery. Thanks flipkart.","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"BoAt Airdopes 131 Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"73af468924ca433e957479faa6d6e347","content":"Best earphone under this price range i have bought sony buds which was available Rs100 more than this price but its sound was low in compare to realme buds2 best earphone under this price range with boosted bass bass is best","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"realme Buds 2 Wired Headset"}},{"_id":"85c02b15a91e43829295ff5c054ad535","content":"Lovely colour and premium looking and connectivity is awesome and impressive better than 3k-4k rs headphones    Trust without and double thought go for it","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"realme Buds Wireless Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"bc6f0a09de53454485a4906a86534447","content":"After using a month, reviewing The best wireless earbuds within this price guys1. Best at bass2. Very nice quality of sound3. I use it for 5-7 hours a day and one charge goes upto 7 days for sure4. Used it in gym as well - no tension about sweat as it's waterproof5. Apart from the black one, other colours could have been better6. Coz of being the best this has got highest rating on 5 start","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"realme Buds Wireless Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"93db28eecc784792b9daca8697d1d243","content":"Realme Buds Bluetooth used details and ratingBattery : 14 hour Music Playing 5/5Key Controller : 4/5Design : flexible velvet type ,-- , ~~ () 5/5Colour : Green 5/5Charging time : 1h:20m full charge 4/5 Stand by : 7 day and 3hour music playing 5/5Music and Bass : good quality , Bass 4/5Compatible  :  Good , 4/5Bluetooth connection : \u25cfPairing in 4 second,,, \u25cfpaired device auto connect 2 second to 4 second . \u25cfMy device 3 second auto connect . 5/5Bluetooth range : \u25cfStraight 75...","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"realme Buds Wireless Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"b530013af10f4a03ac4762481d2ffeb0","content":"Bought these headphones 3 weeks backPros:1. excellent build quality2. Great bass and sound3. light weight and handy4. gives me 10hrs of battery back up5. really good quick chargeCons:1. Missing quick switch button","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bass Edition Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"af8a4f561b3b4f2fa18e9998622acd27","content":"Awesome quality this headfone and sound quality is very nice best disgn and thank flipkart","$v